	"Description": "A simple png image to give you a matching Tractor Shed for Billy's [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9219/]Seasonal Custom Buildings[/url].\u00A0\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />To install: \n<br />1.\u00A0 Download the zip file, extract, and copy the new garage.png\n<br />2. Go into your Mods folder and find the Tractor mod. \n<br />3. Open the assets folder and delete the default garage.png\n<br />4. Paste in the new garage.png\n<br />\n<br />Three versions to choose from, one without a toolbox, one with a red toolbox, and one with a white/chrome toolbox.\u00A0 Pick only one to use.\n<br />\n<br />I thank Billy0815 for the orginal design of this building as I just edited it. I also had his full permission to share it here on Nexus.",
